  "body": "Whether it's a morning walk to the beach, the kids playing in the backyard, or summer evenings entertaining friends on the deck, 120 Brightside Road is all about enjoying the best of coastal living.\r\n\r\nModernised and functional, this single-level home offers three well-proportioned bedrooms, a modern kitchen, spacious open-plan living and a versatile secondary living space. The indoor living seamlessly connects to the north-facing deck and huge flat backyard, creating the perfect setting for family life, entertaining and making memories.\r\n\r\nNeed a little extra space? The separate studio is ideal as a home office, creative studio, teenage retreat or space for summer guests who want to enjoy a slice of what Stanmore Bay has to offer…. \r\n\r\nWith the beach, park, boat ramp, leisure centre, local shopping centre and cafes all just minutes away, everything you need is close at hand and just a short stroll away. Plus, you're in zone for Stanmore Bay Primary School.\r\n\r\nPicture sunny afternoons, barefoot kids running around the backyard and relaxed evenings with friends. That's the Coastie lifestyle waiting for you here.\r\n\r\nWith the vendors moving overseas this property must be sold - now is the time to make your move!\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n\r\n* Modernised, functional single-level home\r\n* Three bedrooms, one bathroom and separate toilet\r\n* Modern kitchen and spacious open-plan living\r\n* Sunny and airy in summer, warm and cosy in winter with the fireplace\r\n* Versatile secondary living / study area\r\n* Secure front and rear yards\r\n* Internal-access garage with additional workshop space\r\n* North-facing deck, perfect for entertaining\r\n* Huge, flat and private backyard\r\n* Separate studio - ideal home office, teenage retreat or guest space\r\n* Minutes walk to the beach, park, boat ramp, leisure centre, local shops and cafe\r\n* Zoned for Stanmore Bay Primary School\r\n* Minutes away from Penlink motorway access\r\n\r\nDeadline Sale - Thursday 12th of November 2026\r\nAgents: Conjunctionals welcome from all agencies.\r\n\r\nTo view property files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/44BL\r\n\r\nContact us to book a private viewing:\r\nNathan Canton 021 088 89478 | Josh Smith 021 235 8802",
